 WordPress</h2><p>This diagram shows the percentages of websites using various versions of WordPress.<p>How to read the diagram:<br>Version 7 is used by 68.6% of all the websites who use WordPress.</p><table class=bars><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/7" rel=nofollow>Version 7</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:207px"></div><td>68.6%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/6" rel=nofollow>Version 6</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:75px"></div><td>24.6%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/5" rel=nofollow>Version 5</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:15px"></div><td>4.6%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/4" rel=nofollow>Version 4</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:7px"></div><td>1.9%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress/3" rel=nofollow>Version 3</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:2px"></div><td>0.2%</table><tr><th class=cap1><td class=cap1>W3Techs.com, 9 November 2026<tr><td class=cap2 colspan=2>Percentages of websites using various versions of WordPress</table><br><h2>Subtechnologies of WordPress</h2><p>This diagram shows the percentages of websites using various subtechnologies of WordPress.<p>How to read the diagram:<br>Elementor is used by 31.5% of all the websites who use WordPress</p><table class=bars><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-elementor">Elementor</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:96px"></div><td>31.5%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-woocommerce">WooCommerce</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="wi