lder</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wpcafe">WPCafe</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wpeasycart">WP EasyCart</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-anspress">AnsPress</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-grandflagallery">Grand Flagallery</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-carrot">Carrot</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wpecommerce">WP eCommerce</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-foodmenu">Food Menu</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-marketpress">MarketPress</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-simplepress">Simple:Press</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th><a class=li href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-pressbooks">Pressbooks</a><td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:1px"></div><td>less than 0.1%</table><tr><th>Other<td><table class=bar><tr><td><div class="bar bar0 b0" style="width:108px"></div><td>35.7%</table><tr><th class=cap1><td class=cap1>W3Techs.com, 9 November 2026<tr><td class=cap2 colspan=2>Percentages of websites using various subtechnologies of WordPress</table><br><h2>Historical trend</h2><p>This diagram shows the historical trend in the percentage of websites using WordPress.<br>Our dedicated trend survey shows more <a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/history_overview/content_management/all">content management usage and market share trends</a>.<img src="https://w3techs.com/diagram/history_technology/cm-wordpress" alt="Historical trends in the usage of WordPress" width=600 height=400 loading=lazy><p>You can find growth rates of WordPress compared to all other content management systems in our <a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/report/cm-wordpress">WordPress market report</a>.<h2>Market position</h2><p>This diagram shows the market position of WordPress in terms of popularity and traffic compared to the most popular content management systems.<br>Our dedicated market survey shows more <a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/market/content_management">content management market data</a>.<p><img src="https://w3techs.com/diagram/market_technology/cm-wordpress" alt="Market position of WordPress" width=600 height=600 loading=lazy><br><br><h2>Popular sites using WordPress</h2><ul><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/microsoft.com">Microsoft.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/wordpress.org">Wordpress.org</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/endpoints.news">Endpoints.news</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/archive.org">Archive.org</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/nginx.org">Nginx.org</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/mit.edu">Mit.edu</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/mozilla.org">Mozilla.org</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/speedtest.net">Speedtest.net</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/tradingview.com">Tradingview.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/opera.com">Opera.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span></ul><h2>Random selection of sites using WordPress</h2><ul><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/besson.fr">Besson.fr</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/drawbotanical.com">Drawbotanical.com</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/novaconsulting.ch">Novaconsulting.ch</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/feuerwehr-edewecht.de">Feuerwehr-edewecht.de</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/boatfloorsmeppel.nl">Boatfloorsmeppel.nl</a></ul><h2>Sites using WordPress only recently</h2><ul><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/speedtest.net">Speedtest.net</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/ubuntu.com">Ubuntu.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on inner pages</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/nature.com">Nature.com</a> <span class=si_hint>used on subdomain</span><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/cnet.com">Cnet.com</a><li><a class=no_und href="https://w3techs.com/sites/info/tencent.com">Tencent.com</a></ul><h2>More examples of sites</h2><p>You can find more examples of sites using WordPress in our <a href="https://w3techs.com/technologies/report/cm-wordpress">WordPress market report</a>, or you can request a <a href="https://w3techs.com/reports/custom">custom web technology market report</a>.<h2>Free technology usage monitoring service</h2><p><a href="https://w3techs.com/users/technologies/cm-wordpress" rel=nofollow>Get a notification</a> when a top site starts using WordPress.<h3>Share this page</h3><ul class="share-buttons"><li><a href="mailto:?subject=Usage statistics and market share of WordPress&body=Usage statistics and market share of WordPress - https://w3techs.com/technologies/details/cm-wordpress?via=keter&query=Inbox+rotation" title="Send email"><img loading=lazy alt="Send email" src="https://w3techs.com/pictures/Email.svg"></a><li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%3Fvia%3Dketer%26query%3DInbox%2Brotation" title="Share on LinkedIn" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" onclick="window.open('https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%3Fvia%3Dketer%26query%3DInbox%2Brotation', '_blank', 'width=600,height=400'); return false;"><img loading=lazy alt="Share on LinkedIn" src="https://w3techs.com/pictures/LinkedIn.svg"></a><li><a href="https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text=Usage+statistics+and+market+share+of+WordPress - https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%3Fvia%3Dketer%26query%3DInbox%2Brotation&via=W3Techs" title="Post on Bluesky" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" onclick="window.open('https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text=Usage+statistics+and+market+share+of+WordPress%20-%20https%3A%2F%2Fw3techs.com%2Ftechnologies%2Fdetails%2Fcm-wordpress%3Fvia%3Dketer%26query%3DInbox%2Brotation&via=W3Techs', '_blank', 'width=600,height=400'); return false;"><img loading=lazy alt="Post on Bluesky" src="https://w3techs.com/pictures/Bluesky.pn